Data notice: this repository contains no ONCF PDFs and no GTFS feed. Those are
downloaded by the user from their publishers and are subject to their own terms
(ONCF terms of use; ODbL for the community GTFS feed). A single small normalized
sample journey in `data/sample/` is included for demonstration only.
